<title>RUSSIA: Russian MinFins stuck in dull play, holidays loom.</title>
<headline>Russian MinFins stuck in dull play, holidays loom.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices of Russian MinFin bonds were little changed in thin trading on Monday as the market dozed ahead of the Christmas and New Year holidays, dealers said.</p>
<p>		 tranche  Dec 23		  Dec 20</p>
<p> 1999 maturity (3)    83.65-83.95	   83.60-83.90</p>
<p> 2003 maturity (4)    59.80-60.10	   59.55-59.85</p>
<p> 2008 maturity (5)    41.80-42.10	   41.75-42.00</p>
<p> 2006 maturity (6)    47.30-47.60	   47.30-47.60</p>
<p> 2011 maturity (7)    35.40-35.70	   34.35-35.65</p>
<p>&quot;There are just two to three players left on the market, and they are quoting rather consistently. No moves are likely until the first days of January,&quot; one dealer said.</p>
<p>Dealers saw only client orders and no arbitrage or speculation.</p>
<p>--Artyom Danielyan, Moscow newsroom (095) 941 8520</p>
